{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB年度壓軸盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今日於將軍澳電視廣播城隆重舉行，全台藝人盛裝出席紅地氈環節爭妍鬥麗 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB年度壓軸盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今日於將軍澳電視廣播城隆重舉行，全台藝人盛裝出席紅地氈環節爭妍鬥麗。今年適逢59周年台慶，一眾當紅小生花旦紛紛換上華麗戰衣展現時尚魅力。當中幾位人氣小花的破格性感造型更意外成為全場焦點，徹底顛覆了過往乖乖女形象。</p>\n<h2>陳卓怡以黑色大方領禮服大曬傲人上圍</h2>\n<p>傍晚時分紅地氈環節率先登場，現場閃光燈閃個不停，氣氛推至高峰。馮熙燮、柯雨霏、胡子貝、徐惠晴及陸卓謙等人率先亮相，隨後出場陳卓怡選穿一件黑色大方領禮服驚艷全場。這套戰衣肩帶特別加入立體蓬起造型，完美襯托出肩頸以及迷人鎖骨線條，更毫不吝嗇地大曬傲人上圍，在鎂光燈下展現出極致性感魅力，瞬間謀殺現場大量菲林。</p>\n<h2>甄敏芳化身夢幻公主佩戴閃石珠飾搶鏡</h2>\n<p>面對一眾性感女星來勢洶洶夾擊，當事人甄敏芳立即以獨特仙氣風格作出回應。她身穿一件銀色帶有淡紫光澤露肩禮服登場，胸前綴滿極具份量閃石、珠飾及垂墜流蘇，在現場強烈燈光照射下呈現出細緻亮澤。為了配合整體造型，她特別戴上銀色藤蔓造型髮飾以及藍色吊墜頸鏈與耳環，眼下更點綴了精緻閃石妝，猶如童話走出來夢幻公主般展現風騷一面。</p>\n<h2>鍾柔美詹天文文凱婷由選秀新人蛻變成花旦</h2>\n<p>回顧過去幾年台慶盛況，不少年輕藝人都會藉著這條紅地氈宣告自己成長。鍾柔美、詹天文、文凱婷以及胡港豐等年輕一輩早年以青澀姿態踏入電視廣播城，如今已經逐漸蛻變成為獨當一面人氣偶像。這班新生代藝人近年在各大劇集與大型綜藝節目中累積大量演出經驗，今次齊齊以成熟高貴打扮亮相59周年台慶盛典，徹底洗脫昔日初出道時稚氣，舉手投足間更散發出大將之風。</p>\n<h2>網民對萬千星輝賀台慶紅地氈造型議論紛紛</h2>\n<p>隨著現場直播畫面曝光，各大社交平台隨即湧現海量討論帖文，大批觀眾對今晚藝人打扮評頭品足。不少支持者瘋狂洗版留言大讚偶像，有網民激動表示「陳卓怡件黑色晚裝真係完美凸顯身材」，亦有人將焦點放在仙氣路線女星身上直指「甄敏芳成個造型簡直係全場最靚公主」。同時有部分眼利觀眾留意到新生代女藝人蛻變，紛紛留言感慨「睇住鍾柔美同詹天文大個女真係好有感觸」，各方熱烈討論令台慶話題熱度持續居高不下。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508352741378280_13075241646afecd0842abf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳卓怡 陳卓怡以黑色大方領禮服大曬傲人上圍（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508352741378280_13075241646afecd0842abf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳卓怡以黑色大方領禮服大曬傲人上圍（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508352878712466_18607106126afecd0929dd3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳卓怡 甄敏芳化身夢幻公主（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508352878712466_18607106126afecd0929dd3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>甄敏芳化身夢幻公主（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508352957939459_6561896186afecd0a0ad18.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳卓怡 鍾柔美詹天文文凱婷都有現身！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508352957939459_6561896186afecd0a0ad18.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>鍾柔美詹天文文凱婷都有現身！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508353107010824_7144907956afecd0b749ab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳卓怡 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508353107010824_7144907956afecd0b749ab.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508353210653836_522411816afecd0c90956.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳卓怡 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508353210653836_522411816afecd0c90956.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508353344457940_15211746826afecd0e3523a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳卓怡 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508353344457940_15211746826afecd0e3523a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%94%84%e6%95%8f%e8%8a%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">甄敏芳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b62026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶2026</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%8d%93%e6%80%a1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳卓怡</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546007\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:36:31.140080+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1367,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:19:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:41.196544+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:29:52.418099+00:00","content_hash":"be2f1d84442a32cb774648f3992b5b6535447814caeaa5d4763cb3c1ef0c4218","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}